```

Adding a new fault test

1. Confirm not redundant (R10)
2. Formulate hypothesis (R9)
3. `testcontainers-go` or `tc`/`iptables`; no mocks
4. >= 20 parallel operations
5. Assert invariants
6. Print `fault_proof fault=<name> ...`
7. Add to catalog if new fault class

Unit / integration standards

- Table-driven business rules; `t.Parallel()` where safe
- Boundary: nil, empty, MaxInt64, negative, bad UTF-8
- No `sqlmock`; isolated transactions with rollback
- Hot path benchmarks: 0 allocs/op
- `go build -gcflags="-m"` for escape analysis on touched hot paths

Smoke before merge: `scripts/ci/deps.sh`, `scripts/deploy/verify_redis_topology.sh`.

OpenRTB latency budget ~20 ms. Mitigations: zero-alloc parse, one Lua hop per request, sorted PG batch updates, dynamic pool timeouts, outbox `SKIP LOCKED`.
